WEBVTT

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.142
Stop! Damn it! Stop!

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.812
Why don’t you ride
on the horse's back!

00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:55.380
Stop!

00:00:58.325 --> 00:01:00.316
Are you all right!?
Mr. Holy Warrior!

00:01:00.494 --> 00:01:02.826
You held on to it well,
for a first timer.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.160
The foot straps must
be helping him.

00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:08.601
| intentionally fell off to
protect the horse’s feelings.

00:01:14.508 --> 00:01:17.671
The rumors about
Holy Warrior Garzey’s Wing...

00:01:17.845 --> 00:01:20.837
have spread like the wind.
Haven't they, Philocres?

00:01:20.881 --> 00:01:24.840
Yes... The scattered Metomeus
tribes have joined together.

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:30.218
The other tribes have offered their
help since we have Garzey’s Wing.

00:01:30.691 --> 00:01:34.025
For these reasons, Lord Chris
is most valuable to us.

00:01:38.866 --> 00:01:40.197
You’re doing well!

00:01:41.535 --> 00:01:42.866
W...Wait for me!

00:01:43.537 --> 00:01:47.565
-Isn’t that Lord Holy Warrior?
-It is.

00:01:49.376 --> 00:01:52.710
The Metomeus tribe has already grown
to be more than a few thousand strong.

00:02:16.904 --> 00:02:21.569
Using Bandou-ran as horses
only makes them exhausted.

00:02:21.742 --> 00:02:25.235
It’s the only way | can
place a Dragorol at Gabujuju.

00:02:25.412 --> 00:02:29.815
You should destroy the Metomeus
with the War-Beast Army Corps.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.083
Don’t you have to let the
Metomeus tribe lead you to...

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:34.414
the Great Barju Tree?

00:02:34.588 --> 00:02:37.580
Some of the survivors
will lead us there.

00:02:37.758 --> 00:02:40.750
Have the War-Beast Army Corps
chase them.

00:02:47.601 --> 00:02:49.592
He's just the general
of the cavalry...

00:02:49.703 --> 00:02:52.695
But he wants to stick his nose
into my War-Beast Army Corps!

00:02:52.773 --> 00:02:55.765
And he thinks he can control
a Dragorol at Gabujuju?!

00:02:55.876 --> 00:02:56.934
What a laugh!

00:03:01.515 --> 00:03:04.075
Food is essential to the
War-Beast Army Corps!

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:05.607
Get going!

00:03:06.453 --> 00:03:10.788
Hurry up!
| can beat Zagizoa!

00:03:10.958 --> 00:03:12.790
There...there.
How is it going?!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:13.586
Going well!

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:21.290
You've got guts to be able
to follow me for half the day.

00:03:27.808 --> 00:03:28.969
How is the clay?

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:31.611
It’s getting bluish,
just as Hassan wanted it.

00:03:31.979 --> 00:03:34.971
If an earthenware bell made
from this clay can make him...

00:03:35.082 --> 00:03:38.985
Garzey’s Holy Warrior,
it will make this war a lot easier.

00:03:40.654 --> 00:03:42.986
We should go back before
the war-beasts find us!

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:43.881
All right!

00:03:45.993 --> 00:03:48.155
Hey Leelince!
How is the clay?

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:49.318
All collected!

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:51.830
Let's go! Otherwise the
Dragorol will eat you up!

00:03:52.499 --> 00:03:53.330
Go...!

00:03:55.335 --> 00:03:56.666
Again?!

00:03:58.839 --> 00:04:03.003
Our hands are not enough
to ring the &amp; bells.

00:04:03.677 --> 00:04:05.338
| see what you mean.

00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:08.007
There is no need to worry.

00:04:08.181 --> 00:04:09.512
We are entering Gabujuju.

00:04:09.683 --> 00:04:12.846
Will the Ishubara
affect the Dragorol?

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:14.684
It should work.

00:04:15.022 --> 00:04:18.014
Although Garzey’s Wing
has appeared...

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:23.027
don’t you think the little fellario
is lowering Lord Chris’s power?

00:04:24.031 --> 00:04:27.023
Who's the one that said
“Don't worry so much"?

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.862
and who made the
escape plan?

00:04:30.704 --> 00:04:33.036
Ondel!l!
isn’t there some other route?

00:04:33.206 --> 00:04:36.039
If we had escaped by
some other route...

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:39.201
we'd already have been eaten by
the War-Beast Army Corps.

00:04:39.546 --> 00:04:40.377
Oh... Thank You.

00:04:41.214 --> 00:04:46.209
Tan Town is held by General
Odajyu Gabu, of the Ashigaba.

00:04:47.888 --> 00:04:50.687
The only way to
defeat them...

00:04:50.824 --> 00:04:53.657
is to use the power of the
divine Barju Tree in the north.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:56.229
Since it’s a leap year...

00:04:56.396 --> 00:04:59.388
| think that we can get
through Sweet Weed road.

00:04:59.466 --> 00:05:01.161
Right, Philocres?

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:05.565
A legend has a meaning!
We can get there.

00:05:06.173 --> 00:05:10.406
Even so, if there is somebody else
who believes in the Barju Tree...

00:05:10.577 --> 00:05:14.411
maybe they can find the money
that King Solon left for us.

00:05:14.581 --> 00:05:17.414
That’s also a legend.

00:05:17.584 --> 00:05:18.574
Is that so?

00:05:18.752 --> 00:05:21.915
In either case, should we
only take this route?

00:05:22.089 --> 00:05:24.683
We must watch out for
the Dragorol....

00:05:24.725 --> 00:05:26.921
living in the
Boundless Plains of Gabujuju.

00:05:27.594 --> 00:05:30.427
-Kurino, please cover this.
-Yes.

00:05:33.433 --> 00:05:38.269
If you use the new bells,
can Chris become Garzey’s Wing?

00:05:38.772 --> 00:05:42.265
lf not...Lord Chris won't
be able to fight.

00:05:42.442 --> 00:05:47.437
We can't gain the people's confidence
if Chris doesn’t become Garzey’s Wing.

00:05:47.514 --> 00:05:51.951
Leelince, aren't you expecting
too much of the man from another world?

00:05:52.119 --> 00:05:53.450
You brought him here!

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.612
If you can’t turn Chris
into the Holy Warrior...

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.454
he'll be the first one to die!

00:05:59.459 --> 00:06:01.791
Hmmoph...
What a nasty girl!

00:06:01.962 --> 00:06:04.624
She's just worried about me.

00:06:05.132 --> 00:06:05.792
Yow!

00:06:06.633 --> 00:06:09.125
You are being a bit wild,
Lord Chris?

00:06:10.804 --> 00:06:12.465
Oh!...Damn!

00:06:13.306 --> 00:06:14.467
Give me an arrow!

00:06:16.143 --> 00:06:17.269
lll use the Ishubara!

00:06:19.312 --> 00:06:19.972
White powder?

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:21.811
lt calms the war-beasts!

00:06:27.821 --> 00:06:31.189
Hey! Don’t come here!
Get away! Damn you!

00:06:31.258 --> 00:06:32.054
Chris!

00:06:37.397 --> 00:06:39.331
Hot!!! Ouch!! Burning hot!!

00:06:39.466 --> 00:06:40.558
Put it out! Put it out!

00:06:42.502 --> 00:06:43.833
What are you doing?

00:06:44.337 --> 00:06:46.499
You called it Ishubara?

00:06:46.673 --> 00:06:51.167
Yes...Ashigaba’s troops put it in
a war-beast’s food to calm them.

00:06:51.344 --> 00:06:54.678
| scatter it to defend us,
when the war-beast shows up.

00:06:55.515 --> 00:06:57.176
Can | have a little?

00:06:59.019 --> 00:07:00.851
Are you going to use it
like the Gada?

00:07:01.188 --> 00:07:03.850
Yes...it should be more
effective this way.

00:07:05.192 --> 00:07:07.183
| see. It’s easy.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.022
It’s what we calla
drug in my world.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:14.524
When you taste or smoke it,
you get happy and do crazy things.

00:07:14.701 --> 00:07:16.863
Yes, it’s a bit dangerous.

00:07:19.039 --> 00:07:21.030
-Kurino...firewood please.
-Yes!

00:07:26.213 --> 00:07:28.204
All right!
You fly and I'll feed you!

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:32.519
Hang on! We'll soon reach
the next transition point.

00:07:43.897 --> 00:07:45.387
This is terrific!

00:07:46.733 --> 00:07:47.723
You can use Gada...

00:07:48.235 --> 00:07:50.727
without it exploding if you
soak it in a rope like this.

00:07:51.571 --> 00:07:56.065
The point is how long you soak
the rope in a Gada-water mix!

00:07:56.243 --> 00:07:58.234
It’s too quick.
Soak it longer!

00:07:58.411 --> 00:07:59.401
| know that!

00:07:59.913 --> 00:08:02.245
And, you have to
completely dry it!

00:08:02.582 --> 00:08:04.414
This is very useful,
Lord Towazzan.

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:07.576
Chris! {found a new way
to use the gunpowder.

00:08:10.924 --> 00:08:11.584
Hey!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.252
What? Everybody’s being
more open with you?

00:08:16.563 --> 00:08:17.587
Chris!

00:08:17.931 --> 00:08:18.591
Hi!

00:08:18.932 --> 00:08:22.095
You look good...for someone
preparing for an exam.

00:08:22.269 --> 00:08:25.933
Hey, you got sexy!
Ms. Tarsier!

00:08:26.606 --> 00:08:28.096
Do you havea
crush on her, Chris?

00:08:28.909 --> 00:08:30.809
Is the Metomeus
tribe doing something?

00:08:32.746 --> 00:08:34.942
Chris’s necklace is jumping!

00:08:35.115 --> 00:08:36.446
Chris, what's wrong?

00:08:49.729 --> 00:08:52.960
You can control the time by
adjusting the length of the fuse.

00:08:53.066 --> 00:08:53.794
How useful...

00:08:54.301 --> 00:08:57.635
Each rope has a slightly
different timing... be careful.

00:08:57.804 --> 00:08:58.327
All right.

00:08:58.638 --> 00:09:02.802
We'll cross the Boundless Plain
in two days without sleeping.

00:09:03.143 --> 00:09:06.135
Ms. Hassan, how did
the bell turn out?

00:09:06.313 --> 00:09:09.305
We’re cooling it right now.
So you can start moving.

00:09:09.482 --> 00:09:11.314
Eufurio..take the
Gada-fuse with you!

00:09:11.651 --> 00:09:14.643
You attach the Gada on this fuse.

00:09:14.988 --> 00:09:16.979
-Tie the meat tightly!
-This is not enough!

00:09:17.324 --> 00:09:20.658
Towazzan, did you invent
the Gada-fuse?

00:09:20.827 --> 00:09:23.319
-No...Lord Holy Warrior did.
-Oh?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:24.991
It’s still not enough.

00:09:25.832 --> 00:09:26.663
Eufurio!

00:09:26.833 --> 00:09:29.666
The cavalry corps should be energetic
so we can attract the Dragorol!!

00:09:29.836 --> 00:09:34.672
Of course, Chief!
Cavalry corps...move out!

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.682
-| appreciate your hard work.
-It’s nothing...

00:09:46.686 --> 00:09:49.678
At Gabujuju, there is just one
Bunzudo is left in our party...

00:09:49.856 --> 00:09:52.518
because we were attacked
by Gabyugas.

00:09:52.692 --> 00:09:55.184
Isn’t that what we expected?

00:09:55.528 --> 00:09:57.690
| could fly all day safely...

00:09:57.864 --> 00:10:00.697
because your corps
took a risk to come here.

00:10:01.201 --> 00:10:03.329
How is the Metomeus tribe doing?

00:10:03.703 --> 00:10:07.697
They're moving along
the northwest side route.

00:10:07.874 --> 00:10:11.367
There’s a den of Dragorol
at the two pillar camp ground.

00:10:11.711 --> 00:10:14.203
It’s just a short
flight from here.

00:10:14.547 --> 00:10:17.539
All right...I'll take
over from here.

00:10:17.717 --> 00:10:20.709
Why don’t you go back and
join General Undo N’gau?

00:10:22.255 --> 00:10:24.724
-ls it not working?
-It’s not working?

00:10:25.225 --> 00:10:27.557
I’ve already selected
the 8 good bells.

00:10:27.727 --> 00:10:30.219
Hassan...It’s time
for us to leave.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.562
Yes...I’m ready.

00:10:42.242 --> 00:10:45.735
Here's your food!
Wake up! You lazy beasts!

00:10:56.423 --> 00:10:58.585
Your food is moving
along to the west!

00:11:39.899 --> 00:11:42.800
The amount of people in the
Metomeus tribe has increased!?

00:11:42.969 --> 00:11:48.169
Damn Hassan! A devious mind hides
inside her innocent beauty!

00:11:48.808 --> 00:11:49.468
What?

00:11:58.118 --> 00:11:58.641
What is it?!

00:11:58.818 --> 00:12:01.253
The Dragorol are
charging in the plains!

00:12:01.688 --> 00:12:02.814
Eufurio's group!

00:12:03.156 --> 00:12:05.147
Gather the archer team
on the right wing!

00:12:05.325 --> 00:12:06.383
Splash Ishubara!

00:12:06.426 --> 00:12:09.123
Don’t splash Ishubara!
Put it on the arrowhead and shoot!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.162
-Are you ready?
-Yes.

00:12:12.832 --> 00:12:14.823
People in the back!
Don’t move!

00:12:15.001 --> 00:12:17.163
There might be another
War-beast coming!

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:19.534
Domon! Try the fuse!

00:12:19.839 --> 00:12:23.173
Sir Dowazzan!
There are more fuses here!

00:12:24.511 --> 00:12:27.674
What's going on?! Why don’t find out
the numbers and direction of the enemy!

00:12:27.847 --> 00:12:28.837
I’m scared!

00:12:29.516 --> 00:12:32.008
Don’t be a coward!
The Metomeus tribe will hate you.

00:12:33.853 --> 00:12:35.343
| understand!

00:12:44.364 --> 00:12:44.853
What?!

00:12:45.031 --> 00:12:46.362
Here comes the fuse!

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.222
We'll use Gada!
Stay away from the war-beasts!

00:13:14.894 --> 00:13:16.055
Where is Hassan?

00:13:23.403 --> 00:13:25.064
Are they using Gada?

00:13:27.407 --> 00:13:30.570
They are using the gunpowder
to protect their tribes!

00:13:38.284 --> 00:13:40.412
Are you all right?
Get up!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.081
I’m all right...thanks.

00:13:42.755 --> 00:13:44.348
Let’s run and attack them!

00:13:44.591 --> 00:13:45.581
We'll use Gada!

00:13:46.092 --> 00:13:47.924
Leelince! Use the Gada!

00:13:48.094 --> 00:13:48.925
Move the food closer!

00:13:49.929 --> 00:13:51.920
The necklace is shaking?

00:13:54.767 --> 00:13:56.428
Make sure the
bells aren't broken.

00:13:56.536 --> 00:13:57.594
They’re not.

00:13:57.770 --> 00:13:59.431
-Ms. Hassan!
-Move!

00:13:59.939 --> 00:14:00.098
Oh!!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.499
A flying beast?!

00:14:04.777 --> 00:14:06.267
| found you, Maiden Hassan!

00:14:11.951 --> 00:14:14.113
You have a serious bruise!

00:14:14.621 --> 00:14:16.419
| don’t feel any pain at all.

00:14:16.623 --> 00:14:18.455
You don’t have a headache?

00:14:18.958 --> 00:14:21.120
Yeah...| don’t feel anything.

00:14:21.628 --> 00:14:22.618
Momma! Catch it for me!

00:14:35.308 --> 00:14:36.298
Chris...!

00:14:36.809 --> 00:14:38.140
It’s not a time to rest!

00:14:38.645 --> 00:14:41.637
W...What?!
The Dragorol didn’t die?!

00:14:46.319 --> 00:14:48.481
The small one is
being swallowed?

00:14:51.991 --> 00:14:54.323
They feed on each other?

00:14:54.594 --> 00:14:56.995
Chris! Get back!
The Dragorol is acting strange.

00:15:08.508 --> 00:15:11.000
Is that the Nine-Headed Dragon
of Hakusan Mountain!

00:15:11.177 --> 00:15:12.667
Domon, Kurino! Use the Gada!

00:15:13.012 --> 00:15:17.176
Why can’t you do something for
us, Yamato-takeru-nomikoto?!

00:15:17.517 --> 00:15:18.848
Throw the Gada at them!

00:15:22.121 --> 00:15:23.520
I'm just half Japanese!

00:15:23.856 --> 00:15:26.188
| can’t act like an
ancient Japanese man!

00:15:32.365 --> 00:15:33.628
Damn!

00:15:36.402 --> 00:15:37.062
You bastard!

00:15:50.049 --> 00:15:50.538
What’s that?!

00:15:51.718 --> 00:15:52.207
You dirty beast!

00:15:52.885 --> 00:15:53.875
Ms. Hassan!

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:55.881
| won’t let you go! Hassan!

00:15:56.756 --> 00:15:59.225
| don’t believe that
you followed me this far!

00:16:00.026 --> 00:16:00.891
Shut up!

00:16:01.227 --> 00:16:03.059
| told you | would
show you compassion!

00:16:04.731 --> 00:16:06.563
-Hassan!
-Lord Chris!

00:16:06.899 --> 00:16:08.458
You bastard!

00:16:09.902 --> 00:16:11.734
| will take this Maiden!

00:16:12.305 --> 00:16:12.828
What?!

00:16:14.741 --> 00:16:15.572
You stopped it?!

00:16:20.913 --> 00:16:21.573
Die!

00:16:25.251 --> 00:16:26.412
Lord Chris!

00:16:28.254 --> 00:16:29.244
Lord Chris!

00:16:36.095 --> 00:16:36.755
Fly!

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.432
Garzey’s Wing!!

00:16:42.602 --> 00:16:44.263
| will take Hassan back!

00:16:50.109 --> 00:16:51.270
Please fly!

00:16:52.779 --> 00:16:55.271
-What’s that light...?
-It must be Garzey’s Wing!

00:16:55.782 --> 00:16:56.613
indeed!

00:16:56.783 --> 00:16:57.944
-Aishe...!
-Tance...!

00:16:58.117 --> 00:16:59.778
Go fly up there
and help him!

00:16:59.886 --> 00:17:01.115
What?...1’m scared!!

00:17:07.627 --> 00:17:10.289
Lord Chris! It’s impossible!
Garzey’s Wing is...

00:17:19.305 --> 00:17:19.965
Chris!

00:17:21.474 --> 00:17:22.635
Lord Chris!

00:17:23.142 --> 00:17:24.132
| beat him!

00:17:26.312 --> 00:17:28.303
L...Lord Chris!

00:17:29.816 --> 00:17:31.648
The wing
is still working!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.128
Defeat Garzey’s Wing!

00:17:54.674 --> 00:17:55.835
Damn it!

00:18:03.683 --> 00:18:05.515
Lord Chris, are you hurt?

00:18:05.852 --> 00:18:07.342
I’m all right.

00:18:07.687 --> 00:18:09.348
What happened to the Dragorol?

00:18:09.522 --> 00:18:11.183
That giant man has beaten it.

00:18:11.691 --> 00:18:14.683
My opponent looked like a
general of the Ashigaba.

00:18:14.861 --> 00:18:17.523
His name is Zaginis Zoa,
a war profiteer.

00:18:18.197 --> 00:18:21.360
He cannot be leading
the army in this area.

00:18:22.335 --> 00:18:25.862
He looked like the one |
fought in the limestone cave.

00:18:26.038 --> 00:18:29.531
He is...like a snake.

00:18:33.713 --> 00:18:37.206
Sir Tawrad, would
you come with us?

00:18:37.383 --> 00:18:40.045
Although, we can't pay you until
after we rebuild our country.

00:18:40.219 --> 00:18:42.551
No...| ‘d like to stay on my own.

00:18:42.722 --> 00:18:44.713
Although I'm looking for an employer...

00:18:44.757 --> 00:18:47.727
| would rather watch the Metomeus'
success from the distance.

00:18:48.494 --> 00:18:50.553
He flew in the sky,
didn’t he?

00:18:50.663 --> 00:18:52.392
Yeah, | saw it.

00:18:55.234 --> 00:18:57.225
That kind of man
may be a Holy Warrior too.

00:18:57.570 --> 00:19:00.733
l understand that we need a warrior
but isn’t he from a different tribe?

00:19:02.742 --> 00:19:05.575
After Ashigaba's reign began,
there were many drifters...

00:19:05.678 --> 00:19:06.907
who worked for money.

00:19:07.246 --> 00:19:08.736
He might be a spy.

00:19:08.915 --> 00:19:11.577
No spy wants to
wander into Gabujuju.

00:19:12.752 --> 00:19:15.084
Falan...
Keep your eye on him.

00:19:15.755 --> 00:19:16.745
Got it!

00:19:19.926 --> 00:19:22.418
My necklace?...Rumiko?

00:19:23.763 --> 00:19:26.255
Rumiko?
Why are you here?

00:19:26.766 --> 00:19:28.256
| felt guilty...

00:19:28.334 --> 00:19:31.770
being angry at you for going
back to your hometown.

00:19:31.938 --> 00:19:33.929
Look! You know
this is Kanazawa.

00:19:34.106 --> 00:19:35.938
His girlfriend followed
him from Tokyo!

00:19:36.108 --> 00:19:37.098
It’s not like that!

00:19:37.276 --> 00:19:39.267
Your necklace is jumping.

00:19:39.445 --> 00:19:42.608
The story of the mind-body
separation must be true.

00:19:42.949 --> 00:19:45.441
Wait a minute.
Let me sit down.

00:19:45.785 --> 00:19:46.274
Chris.

00:19:46.786 --> 00:19:48.777
Chris...you should lie down.

00:19:48.955 --> 00:19:51.447
I’m Ok...1 just felt dizzy.

00:19:51.624 --> 00:19:54.616
Chris had a strange
experience last night.

00:19:54.794 --> 00:19:57.286
Has that happened
in Tokyo, too?

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:00.622
No... The necklace
is really shaking.

00:20:06.305 --> 00:20:08.797
The key point to war
is reconnaissance...

00:20:08.908 --> 00:20:11.468
Isn't that what Reijiro,
the game maniac, always says?

00:20:11.811 --> 00:20:12.972
/ can believe that.

00:20:13.145 --> 00:20:15.978
larsier said the perfect tool
for that is a kite or balloon.

00:20:16.315 --> 00:20:18.647
Where do you think
f can make helium gas?!

00:20:18.885 --> 00:20:22.480
Shit! Then can you make a gun?!

00:20:22.989 --> 00:20:25.321
How can we make a
hole in a metal shatt?

00:20:25.491 --> 00:20:26.822
You cast a mold.

00:20:26.993 --> 00:20:28.984
larsier Adachi told you so?

00:20:29.128 --> 00:20:30.152
that’s right!

00:20:30.329 --> 00:20:33.526
How can we forge nuts and bolts?
it’s impossible!

00:20:33.599 --> 00:20:37.934
Look! You make a bolt first. and stick
the bolt in a tube while it's still hot.

00:20:38.037 --> 00:20:40.836
Then you can make a mold of the nut.

00:20:44.343 --> 00:20:46.675
| was able to talk to
Chris on the other side.

00:20:46.846 --> 00:20:48.837
-Chris on the other side?
-Yeah.

00:20:49.015 --> 00:20:52.007
Did you explain about a
group circular movement?

00:20:52.118 --> 00:20:52.676
Of course.

00:20:53.019 --> 00:20:54.680
I’m sorry | made
you all worry...

00:20:54.854 --> 00:20:56.686
Is it my fault you
are feeling like this?

00:20:57.023 --> 00:21:00.015
Yamato-takeru-nomikoto is
the one who caused this.

00:21:00.126 --> 00:21:01.355
Why don’t you
join us for dinner?

00:21:01.527 --> 00:21:02.187
But...

00:21:02.361 --> 00:21:05.820
It’s all right. It’s better
for Chris if you stay with him.

00:21:06.198 --> 00:21:07.529
Is it ok...Chris?

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:11.534
Of course, it is.
| can’t go it alone.

00:21:11.604 --> 00:21:13.629
Oh...Really?

00:21:18.878 --> 00:21:21.870
We can defeat their
cavalry with this.

00:21:22.548 --> 00:21:26.382
Philocres, You make a hole in the metal
tube and close the other side?

00:21:26.686 --> 00:21:29.553
It is easy to make a screw
by casting a mold.

00:21:29.889 --> 00:21:30.685
Let me think...

00:21:32.391 --> 00:21:34.223
| have another idea...

00:21:34.393 --> 00:21:37.886
| want to have cavalry corps
practicing circling all at once.

00:21:39.065 --> 00:21:40.055
Cavalry corps?

00:21:40.232 --> 00:21:43.065
The only way the cavalry corps
can fight is by breaking through.

00:21:43.235 --> 00:21:46.068
If we fight the infantry that way,
they will attack us while we circle.

00:21:46.238 --> 00:21:50.402
We have to circle quickly.
We need a stirrup to do this.

00:21:50.576 --> 00:21:54.570
But we can use spears to
stand our ground firmly.

00:21:56.082 --> 00:21:59.074
All right! Eufurio...Let's have
the young people practice this.

00:21:59.185 --> 00:22:00.914
-But...
-They want to try it.

00:22:01.087 --> 00:22:01.576
All right.

00:22:01.754 --> 00:22:04.746
Developing a gun is
Ondel’s assignment.

00:22:04.924 --> 00:22:06.915
My pleasure.

00:22:08.094 --> 00:22:11.587
Well, Lord Zaginis Zoa...
| heard about your great job.

00:22:11.764 --> 00:22:15.428
Please go back from
here with our new Bunzudo.

00:22:15.601 --> 00:22:19.435
There must be another strategy
awaiting you in our homeland?

00:22:19.705 --> 00:22:22.436
| will go back...

00:22:22.608 --> 00:22:25.600
The Metomeus are using
Gada very skillfully now.

00:22:25.778 --> 00:22:26.939
You’d better be extra careful.

00:22:27.046 --> 00:22:30.038
We'll take advantage of the
Gell Mountains’ landscape...

00:22:30.116 --> 00:22:31.106
and kill them all.

00:22:31.283 --> 00:22:35.117
Scout party! Why are you waiting?!
Hurry up and take off!

00:22:47.366 --> 00:22:50.961
Undo N'gau's War-Beasts
crossed the Boundless Plain...

00:22:51.137 --> 00:22:54.129
by themselves,
to reach Gabajuju.

00:22:54.473 --> 00:22:59.809
| will not have the credit taken
by a newcomer like Zagizoa.

00:23:20.833 --> 00:23:23.666
Falan, You should
find out where...

00:23:23.836 --> 00:23:26.828
the Ashigaba’s war-beasts
are on this map.

00:23:27.173 --> 00:23:28.663
| didn’t see anything.

00:23:28.841 --> 00:23:31.833
Follow the direction where
the Bunzudo fly from.

00:23:32.011 --> 00:23:35.845
But, I’m scared of them.
What can | get if | do it?

00:23:36.015 --> 00:23:37.779
I'll have my people
prepare dumplings...

00:23:37.883 --> 00:23:40.853
made from lily pollen
with morning dew.

00:23:42.455 --> 00:23:43.854
You have to promise!

00:23:44.023 --> 00:23:46.515
You make a promise that...

00:23:46.692 --> 00:23:49.684
if you told a lie, then you
will swallow 1,000 needles!

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:54.192
What made you think you can
use a Fellario for scouting?

00:23:54.366 --> 00:23:56.858
Chief! What are you thinking?

00:23:57.036 --> 00:23:58.697
A Fellario can't read a map.

00:23:58.871 --> 00:24:02.535
Even the war-beasts must
get tired from traveling...

00:24:02.708 --> 00:24:06.201
If we take out their supply unit,
we can limit their actions.

00:24:07.046 --> 00:24:11.040
Wasn’t Lord Chris telling us
to use a kite or balloon?

00:24:37.910 --> 00:24:43.405
| will crush the Metomeus tribe
for revolting against King Fungun.

00:24:58.430 --> 00:25:00.762
Did the bird-beast
corps pass through?

00:25:00.933 --> 00:25:02.423
Falan, good work!

00:25:02.768 --> 00:25:05.430
There’s infantry in
the supply unit!

00:25:05.538 --> 00:25:08.098
Let's hit them before the
war-beasts come back!

00:25:08.274 --> 00:25:09.764
The fuse corps should lead!

00:25:09.942 --> 00:25:13.435
Attack with spears and
Gada at the same time!

00:25:13.612 --> 00:25:15.102
Others! Hold your positions!

00:25:29.962 --> 00:25:31.794
We must crush this supply unit?

00:25:35.801 --> 00:25:37.462
-What's wrong?
-I’m cold.

00:25:37.636 --> 00:25:38.296
What?

00:25:38.470 --> 00:25:39.631
Geta taxi....

00:25:39.805 --> 00:25:41.796
-We should take him home.
-Yeah.

00:25:45.311 --> 00:25:46.472
Wagon unit!
Break through!

00:25:46.645 --> 00:25:47.476
Surprise attack!

00:25:47.613 --> 00:25:48.637
Load the bows!

00:25:51.984 --> 00:25:54.476
General!...A message for
General Undo N'gau!

00:25:54.653 --> 00:25:55.484
It’s begun!

00:26:11.337 --> 00:26:13.328
Join the main force!

00:26:30.289 --> 00:26:31.688
Don’t stay on the horse!

00:26:47.506 --> 00:26:48.496
Hey!

00:26:49.241 --> 00:26:50.709
Get up!

00:27:21.073 --> 00:27:25.067
If the supply unit falls, the
War-Beast Corps comes to a halt.

00:27:25.244 --> 00:27:29.306
But, the war-beasts will
become wild because of it.

00:27:29.415 --> 00:27:32.077
-Has it started?
-| think so.

00:27:35.754 --> 00:27:38.246
May the grace of Garzey’s Wing
be with them!

00:27:39.758 --> 00:27:41.749
Chris...can he do it?

00:27:43.595 --> 00:27:45.586
It’s going to explode!

00:27:48.934 --> 00:27:49.765
You bastard!

00:27:52.104 --> 00:27:53.094
I'll get you!

00:27:53.605 --> 00:27:54.436
Sechuku!

00:27:54.606 --> 00:27:56.096
Somebody!
Back me up!

00:28:09.121 --> 00:28:12.147
Garzey's Wing...
Why won’t you help me?!
